Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.13,0:00:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pulang!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.59,0:00:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat datang kembali.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.95,0:00:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini juga melelahkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mantan pengurung diri sepertiku
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.99,0:00:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tak cocok jadi guru di sekolah perempuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Energi siswi SMA tak main-main!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tiap hari, tenaga dan mentalku\Nterkuras habis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah dipikir, sebelum bereinkarnasi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.04,0:00:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sebelum menjadi Raja Iblis,\Naku hanya seorang penyihir yang gila sihir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.91,0:00:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan terobsesi meneliti sihir setiap hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.25,0:00:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah menjadi penyihir istana,\Naku mulai harus tampil di depan banyak orang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.57,0:00:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat itu pun, mentalku remuk setiap hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.69,0:00:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Momen saat aku menjadi\NRaja Iblis lumayan seru.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.73,0:00:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena di pasukan Raja Iblis\Ntak ada manusia hidup,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.36,0:00:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bisa santai sambil banyak\Nmembaca buku sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.52,0:00:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata, di kehidupan sebelumnya pun\Naku sudah mengurung diri.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:00:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebaiknya mati saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.41,0:01:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Abang, kamu baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.97,0:02:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Abang, kenapa dulu kamu\Ntiba-tiba mengurung diri?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.22,0:02:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah menjadi guru,\Nkamu kelihatannya menjalani hidup normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.41,0:02:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ada hal tak menyenangkan di sekolah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana menjelaskannya, ya?\NSebenarnya agak rumit,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.16,0:02:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi singkatnya, mungkin karena patah hati.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serius?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia berhenti kerja gara-gara patah hati?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.41,0:02:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu bangkit lagi karena ada cinta yang baru?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata abangku terobsesi dengan percintaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.09,0:03:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu salah paham!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kehidupan sebagai guru\Npenuh dengan masalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah! Perasaanku tidak enak!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narukami-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.41,0:03:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa rumor Sensei menerima\Nkonseling apa pun itu benar?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rumor itu baru kamu buat barusan, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.59,0:03:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Banyak masalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satsuki, sebenarnya ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.01,0:03:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begini...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.01,0:03:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anu, bisa bahas ini berdua saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Merekam diam-diam?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, ruang ekskul kami direkam diam-diam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.48,0:03:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku merasa ini harus dibicarakan\Ndengan guru pembimbing dan anggota lainnya,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.27,0:03:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi masalahnya bisa jadi makin besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebentar lagi ada turnamen,\Naku tak ingin membuat semuanya cemas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.49,0:03:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi aku panik dan mencari seseorang\Nyang mau mendengarkanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.56,0:03:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.12,0:04:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah.\NAku akan membantumu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.60,0:04:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kalau tak bisa ditangani, kamu harus\Nkonsultasi dengan guru pembimbingmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.06,0:04:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku yang tadinya cemas,\Nsekarang jadi senang mendengarnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.90,0:04:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mentalku juga sedang tak stabil\Nkarena aku malah menjatuhkan ponselku.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.09,0:04:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sensei juga, semangat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.82,0:04:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sementara,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.13,0:04:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku akan berkunjung ke ekskul atletik.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.95,0:04:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong jelaskan situasinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.26,0:04:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamera ini kutemukan di atas loker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dalam keadaan sedang merekam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.21,0:04:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa isi rekamannya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rekaman saat semuanya ganti pakaian.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.41,0:04:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena isi rekamannya seperti itu,\Naku tak bisa menunjukkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.30,0:04:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat sedang kegiatan ekskul,\Npintunya selalu kami kunci.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.09,0:04:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuncinya pun dipegang Ketua.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.28,0:04:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jendelanya selalu dibuka untuk ventilasi,\Nmustahil orang bisa masuk lewat sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.10,0:04:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku tak ada maksud mencurigai mereka...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.92,0:04:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang yang lokernya terekam\Noleh arah kamera,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.59,0:04:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}lalu orang yang tak terekam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.39,0:04:56.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu orang yang hari ini absen latihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.67,0:04:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sebenarnya asisten detektif atau apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.29,0:05:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini pasti membuatnya sangat cemas\Nkarena terjadi di antara temannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.45,0:05:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin masalah ini selesai\Ntanpa heboh, tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.08,0:05:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan membantu semampuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mohon bantuannya, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.63,0:05:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Andai saja ini bisa dibereskan dengan sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.32,0:05:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm, aku harus bagaimana, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau mencari barang,\Nbisa langsung selesai dengan sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, Takigawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.95,0:05:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.98,0:05:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya, masalah Returner sudah selesai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.31,0:05:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah ini, apa kegiatan kalian?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.92,0:05:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.73,0:05:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katanya masih ada banyak pintu dimensi\Nyang dibuka Takanashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.59,0:05:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi kami masih punya banyak urusan\Nyang harus dibereskan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu, grup yang mengincar sumber daya\Ndan teknologi dari dunia lain juga mulai bergerak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.62,0:05:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masalah ini masih terus berjalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.58,0:05:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasti berat, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.11,0:05:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kepalaku pusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.03,0:05:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan memaksakan diri, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:03.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya, apa ada sihir yang bisa\Nmengetahui pemilik suatu benda?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada sihir yang sepraktis itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.19,0:06:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa, Nagamori?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan mendekat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.79,0:06:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Jangan mendekat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.99,0:06:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ladangnya rusak...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.04,0:06:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ladangku...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.01,0:06:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi ini ladangmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu seperti elf yang hutannya dibakar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau mau, aku bisa bantu cari pelakunya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.75,0:06:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak butuh bantuan manusia!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.71,0:06:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia seperti elf yang menutup hatinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.43,0:06:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor, ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sedang mencari sesuatu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.69,0:06:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, tidak, aku sedang jalan-jalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya Mako konsultasi padamu,\Napa semuanya baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, ada sedikit masalah di ekskul atletik.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:07:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada murid ekskul atletik yang mukanya pucat\Ndan mondar-mandir seperti kehilangan barang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.07,0:07:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kehilangan barang?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.28,0:07:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.35,0:07:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku agak cemas karena kelihatannya serius.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tahu namanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia Nishina-san dari kelas 2-3.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.\NItu sangat membantu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.51,0:07:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu juga cepat pulang, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.04,0:07:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soal kamera itu,\Npelakunya kamu, kan, Nishina?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.59,0:07:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pasti ada alasan khusus\Nmelakukannya, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.23,0:07:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalung pemberian pacarku hilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pikir mungkin dicuri di ruang ekskul...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin aku juga cuma salah paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Turnamen juga sebentar lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.61,0:07:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak ingin semuanya cemas\Nkarena masalah pencurian,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.37,0:07:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi aku pasang kamera\Nuntuk mencari pencurinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.86,0:07:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku terlalu terburu-buru mencoba\Nmencari pelakunya sendirian.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.77,0:07:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maafkan aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan cemas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.47,0:07:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satsuki yang menemukannya\Ndan dia belum cerita pada siapa pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.15,0:07:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.99,0:07:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula, aku jago mencari benda hilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.59,0:08:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pelakunya...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.22,0:08:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Burung gagak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia yang mengambil benda berhargamu\Nlalu membawanya ke sarangnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini!\NIni aksesoriku!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.45,0:08:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya dia masuk\Nlewat jendela kecil itu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya ada benda lain yang dicuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.28,0:08:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ladang dia juga dirusak mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Singkatnya, kamera itu dipasang untuk mencari\Npencuri aksesori, bukan untuk mengintai orang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.31,0:08:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masalah pencurian juga selesai, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.95,0:08:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.79,0:08:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, Mako!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.35,0:08:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bertindak sendiri karena tak ingin\Nmasalah pencurian ini heboh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.11,0:08:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga paham karena tak bisa konsultasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.84,0:08:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi ini Kota Mitsurugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.77,0:08:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mengawasi para penyihir OZ\Nsepertinya keputusan yang tepat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:09:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Banyak pintu dimensi,\Nini kesempatan langka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.23,0:09:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster sihir, makhluk fantasi,\Npedang sihir, batu sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.79,0:09:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bisa menghasilkan banyak uang.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.19,0:09:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertama, singkirkan orang-orang OZ\Nyang mengganggu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.27,0:09:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, tapi sumber daya\Ndari dunia lain akan kami ambil semua.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.53,0:09:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, misi dimulai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.31,0:09:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang akan memegang kendali
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah kami, WAND.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak akan membiarkan\Nhal seperti itu terjadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.47,0:09:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serangan ini adalah Soul Crush\Njarak maksimum,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.07,0:09:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}hasil gabungan Spell Enhance dan Hawk Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.92,0:09:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah menghancurkan mentalmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.96,0:09:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidurlah selama setengah bulan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.94,0:09:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar.\NIni janggal, musuh datang tiba-tiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.53,0:09:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untungnya dia lengah karena mengira aman\Ndari serangan jarak jauh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kali ini aku berutang padamu, Takigawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.07,0:09:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, berikutnya masalah terakhir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.00,0:10:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu kelihatan lelah, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.61,0:10:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lumayan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.59,0:10:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini, barangmu yang jatuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, ini cincinku!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cincin itu ada di sarang\Nburung gagak pencuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.61,0:10:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.11,0:10:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harusnya bilang padaku, pasti akan kucari.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.89,0:10:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku baru mendapatkannya, sulit bilang\Nkalau aku langsung kehilangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.28,0:10:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan dipikirkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.80,0:10:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jagonya mencari barang hilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pasti mengatasinya dengan sihir, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.69,0:10:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah susah payah mencarinya...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan pernah lupa perasaan\Nsaat pertama kali kalian memulai sesuatu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.01,0:10:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa arti dari ungkapan nasihat itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.31,0:10:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nagamori, kamu tahu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.15,0:11:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya!\NJangan lupakan ni-niat awal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.91,0:11:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hampir benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.85,0:11:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan lupakan niat a-a-a-a-wal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa jadi begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.72,0:11:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}SMA Putri Mitsurugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.48,0:11:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekolah ternama yang mendidik\Npara gadis anggun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, malas.\NApa dunia tak bisa hancur sekarang saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serahkan padaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.64,0:11:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku yang akan menghancurkan dunia!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi cita-citamu menjadi Raja Iblis, ya?\NSemangat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.53,0:11:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.65,0:11:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka para gadis anggun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.09,0:11:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.72,0:11:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu putri orang kaya, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.55,0:11:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar!\NAku gadis cantik, kaya, dan populer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.04,0:11:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sangat objektif pada dirimu sendiri, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, kamu tidak berambut ikal panjang,\Ngaya bicaramu juga tidak bangsawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.23,0:11:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kesan putrinya masih kurang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.95,0:11:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan, karakterku kurang kuat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.43,0:11:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seorang putri tak perlu memikirkan\Nsoal karakter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.29,0:11:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Belakangan ini Narukami-sensei keren, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:11:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Be-Begitu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin karena sudah terbiasa\Natau sudah terlihat lebih tenang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.23,0:12:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya, ulang tahunnya sebentar lagi, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau kasih beliau hadiah apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.63,0:12:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hadiah, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tempo hari kamu memberinya\Ndasi sebagai hadiah, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.04,0:12:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, itu ganti rugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau memberi hadiah, bagusnya apa, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.89,0:12:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Barang yang elegan dan cocok\Nuntuk seorang putri, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.60,0:12:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pena tinta?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.97,0:12:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jawabannya langsung keluar, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu langsung mengeluarkan\Npesonamu sebagai putri kaya, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.07,0:12:36.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini harganya terlalu mahal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.99,0:12:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebaiknya kita batalkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.49,0:12:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula, aku belum pernah
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}memberi hadiah pada cowok.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bikin bingung, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya, hadiah itu biasanya dari cowok, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.21,0:12:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Matsurika, menurutmu apa hadiah yang bagus?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.99,0:13:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm, benar juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.85,0:13:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau beri hadiah\Nmakanan ringan atau kue?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.43,0:13:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia bilang sesuatu yang masuk akal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.56,0:13:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau makan kue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu cuma ingin memakannya sendiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.39,0:13:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau bahas hadiah buat cowok,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.57,0:13:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sudah pasti Valentine, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita tidak sedang bahas itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu bisa buat cokelat\Nuntuk orang yang kamu suka?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.12,0:13:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita ini sedang bahas apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.49,0:13:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula, aku tidak semanis itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.47,0:13:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malah coba buat lelucon bagus, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.07,0:13:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cokelat doang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tadi aku lewat depan kelas 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hanaori sedang bahas soal Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.21,0:13:39.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dunia komedi romantis memang selalu\Nmenghadirkan Valentine di waktu yang tepat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa mereka tak ada bahasan\Nselain percintaan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.72,0:13:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau mengawasi mereka sebentar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu juga sebenarnya ingin ikutan, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.22,0:13:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuharap bahasannya soal percintaan gadis!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.77,0:13:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepat sembuh, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.85,0:13:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narukami-sensei, apa kamu populer\Nsaat menjadi siswa dulu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.32,0:13:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Aku biasa saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.11,0:14:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biasa saja?\NBiasa untuk cowok itu seperti apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:03.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ma-Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.51,0:14:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku hanya pernah dapat cokelat dari\NIbu dan adik perempuanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.96,0:14:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rokudo-sensei berhasil\Nmembuat Narukami-sensei terpojok.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.37,0:14:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tahu ini klise,\Ntapi "Aku yang akan jadi hadiahnya!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.57,0:14:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin itu hadiah terbaik.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.32,0:14:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa maksudnya itu?\NSiapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.55,0:14:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu kesannya mesum!\NTidak mau!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini demi Sensei, berkorbanlah sedikit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.64,0:14:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mengandalkan pesona kontras, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.52,0:14:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau lumuri tubuhmu dengan cokelat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.84,0:14:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Matsurika!\NAku tak bisa beli cokelat sebanyak itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.99,0:14:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masalahnya di situ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.56,0:14:40.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, tinggal sembunyikan\Nbagian sensitifmu saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tetap tidak boleh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.67,0:14:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka sedang bahas apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.57,0:14:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selagi memikirkannya,\Nkita sebaiknya sambil nyemil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.59,0:14:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.83,0:14:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hanaori-san, hari ini kamu bebas diet?\NIni buatmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.29,0:14:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu juga boleh makan camilanku!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.54,0:15:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hanaori-kun, kebanyakan nyemil nanti gemuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.20,0:15:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hati-hati, Meteor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.51,0:15:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semangatku membara, Memento Mori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik, mari kita mulai sesi wali kelasnya\Nsebelum pulang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.02,0:15:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertama, soal pekan kebersihan\Nminggu depan...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai sekarang, dilarang bawa camilan ke sekolah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.23,0:15:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, besok mau pergi patroli?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.35,0:15:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Besok kan libur.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.45,0:15:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kamu bilang?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ikut.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, aku membuatmu menunggu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu telat lima menit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.83,0:15:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.17,0:15:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu malah tak ada semangat, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:15:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Se-Setelanmu sangat santai, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.83,0:16:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini untuk jaga-jaga, lebih baik pakai baju\Nyang mudah dipakai untuk bertarung.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Itu benar juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.03,0:16:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kamu...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terlihat sangat cantik, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.39,0:16:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cewek harus selalu siap\Nmenghadapi pertempuran kapan saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.99,0:16:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertempuran macam apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertarungan soal penampilan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.95,0:16:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat keluar, cewek punya\Ntujuh musuh yang menunggu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.83,0:16:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa malah marah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi pada akhirnya, masih ada\Nmasalah yang belum selesai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.16,0:16:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, sepertinya masih ada\Nlubang dimensi yang belum ditemukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.09,0:16:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau semuanya belum ditutup,\Nmonster akan bermunculan satu per satu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.73,0:16:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, bagaimana cara mencari lubang dimensi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.57,0:16:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harusnya bisa kita rasakan\Nsaat pintunya aktif.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.24,0:16:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kapan aktifnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.99,0:16:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat ada monster keluar?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.84,0:16:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kapan monsternya keluar?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entahlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.32,0:16:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malah, "Eh".
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.92,0:16:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, kita harus bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita cuma bisa keliling kota\Nsampai ada yang muncul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.55,0:17:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sampai ada yang datang, kamu bebas\Npergi belanja atau minum teh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.04,0:17:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.00,0:17:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malah jadi kencan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.84,0:17:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau monster tidak muncul?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.15,0:17:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu, itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.33,0:17:11.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rokudo-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.93,0:17:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau ketahuan, kita bisa dimarahi lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.93,0:17:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita kabur dulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.06,0:17:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke sini!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Iya!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.77,0:17:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita masuk dulu ke mal ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.28,0:17:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mal yang penuh kopel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.15,0:17:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk sementara,\Nkita habiskan waktu dulu di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.76,0:17:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini kencan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.85,0:17:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku boleh beli oleh-oleh\Nuntuk adikku dulu?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini kencan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.95,0:17:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tak ada monster muncul,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.35,0:17:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ini betulan kencan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.88,0:17:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster, keluarlah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.37,0:17:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rapat dalam pikiran Hanaori!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.58,0:17:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini kencan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.87,0:17:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kencan yang sempurna!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.36,0:17:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kencan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.21,0:17:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kencan, meong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kencan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:46.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keluarlah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.65,0:17:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makan yang manis untuk memulihkan MP, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.49,0:17:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enak!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:17:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aura kebahagiaannya silau!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.85,0:18:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa malah menatapku terus?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.93,0:18:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu terlihat menikmatinya, jadi refleks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.56,0:18:06.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa boleh buat, ini enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.31,0:18:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, apa boleh buat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.87,0:18:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.29,0:18:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tahu akan begini,\Nharusnya aku tampil lebih rapi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.07,0:18:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.08,0:18:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rambutku juga berantakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.87,0:18:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata Raja Iblis juga punya\Nrasa malu seperti manusia?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.89,0:18:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, kamu jalan dengan gadis cantik,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.57,0:18:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}wajar kalau merasa malu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.55,0:18:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.59,0:18:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu mustahil bagiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa belakangan ini\Nkamu mulai terbiasa dengan sekolah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelihatannya begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.51,0:18:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Belakangan ini rambutmu terlihat lebih rapi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.77,0:18:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.99,0:18:48.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena stres yang menumpuk,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.40,0:18:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}rambutku sampai kusut.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.49,0:18:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rambutmu kusut parah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.78,0:18:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, itu momen yang berat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baru mulai kerja langsung dipojokkan\Nke dinding sama wanita aneh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.77,0:18:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu, ada OZ dan alien, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.50,0:19:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau itu seru.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.27,0:19:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal kalau ada cerita "Raja Iblis jadi guru\Ndi sekolah pahlawan" bakal seru.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.68,0:19:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal?\NApa maksudnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.52,0:19:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kesannya jadi beda, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.88,0:19:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau itu, aku paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.18,0:19:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ini karena kita punya atribut
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tak gampang terseret masalah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.37,0:19:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Atribut macam apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.89,0:19:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita tidak ada di tempat kejadian.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masalah yang merepotkan\Njuga sudah ditangani OZ.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.81,0:19:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita dipuji karena pergi sekolah tiap hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.75,0:19:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu terlalu blakblakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.36,0:19:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terlebih, hari ini monster tidak muncul!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, kamu menikmatinya setiap hari\Ndan tak punya masalah, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.66,0:19:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga punya masalah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.55,0:19:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm, misalnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.25,0:19:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat!\NTiap hari ternyata seru, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.67,0:19:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada hasil.\NHari ini sepertinya nihil, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.43,0:19:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.64,0:20:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sangat suka niatmu\Nyang ingin melindungi orang lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalaupun nihil,\Ntetap lakukan apa yang kamu yakini.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.40,0:20:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.93,0:20:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama itu tidak menghabiskan hari liburku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kamu bilang?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di rumah pun, kamu pasti cuma duduk lama\Nmain gim tak jelas, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.36,0:20:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gim macam apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.24,0:20:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.55,0:20:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau terus begini malah jadi kencan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.45,0:20:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster atau apa pun, yang penting muncul!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.16,0:20:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu! Mau masuk dunia hiburan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:26.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku menolak!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.75,0:20:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu yang di sana!\NAda roh jahat yang menempel padamu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada yang memanggilmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang apa lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.84,0:20:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Muncul!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.85,0:20:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini bukan kencan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.29,0:22:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monsternya kita kalahkan dengan mudah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.68,0:22:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga bisa belanja banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.19,0:22:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan belanja banyak\Nkalau tak sanggup dibawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.35,0:22:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu, jangan nyemil\Nterang-terangan di kelas!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.81,0:22:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.05,0:22:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cokelat bisa membuat otak lebih aktif.\NMembantu belajar juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.83,0:22:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Profesional sogi dan orang yang kerjanya\Nberpikir juga mengonsumsi gula, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.34,0:22:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau konsentrasi meningkat,\Nsihir juga jadi lebih kuat, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.71,0:22:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pintar cari alasan, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.65,0:22:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, beri aku cokelat juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.33,0:22:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu, ya, tanganku penuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.07,0:22:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.37,0:22:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nih.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.39,0:22:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.57,0:23:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ja-Jangan salah paham!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.96,0:23:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.15,0:23:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kubilang...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.61,0:23:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namaku Couple Buster J.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.44,0:23:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menghukum kopel yang bermesraan\Ndi kota adalah keadilanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.08,0:23:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, kopel yang canggung\Nseperti itu biarkan saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini, suasana hatiku sedang bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.67,0:23:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, Ryusei, kamu suka kucing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.03,0:23:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, aku tidak benci mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.48,0:23:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya aku dibenci para hewan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.55,0:23:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berarti, kamu senang kalau ada\Nkucing lucu yang menghampirimu?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.06,0:23:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Kita sedang bahas apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.19,0:23:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tinggal bilang senang saja susah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.93,0:23:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kubilang, kita sedang bahas apa?
